ity in a neighboring  area is also using the technique their  solar dryer has a significantly larger  capacity they can dry some 450 kilograms  of corn beans and rice within just two  days  farmers use a hydrometer to determine  when their produce is fully dry that is  valuable information per DL cincuenta  prevent oh I once lost about half my cry  when we had two weeks of rain during  harvest time I packed the beans and the  sacks without noticing that they weren't  properly dry entonces el motivo de la  pérdida the solar dryers are  manufactured year close to the capital  Managua the Austrian firm Kona supplies  the components it also holds the patent  more than 80 such units are already in  use throughout Nicaragua providing  farmers with an environmentally friendly  alternative logo da Mo's our system  allows us to use solar power rather than  Lada fires to dry cocoa beans concrete I  meant a wa la la in the walala area for  example the forest is being recklessly  cut down to provide wood for the drying  process since no one is thinking about  reforestation the trees will soon be  gone Sierra para que no de NOC Savino  one of the most powerful units in the  country can be found at the University  of Leon the forty square meters of solar  panels produce a great deal of hot air  the university's department of food  technology is studying the solar dryers  students and professors are testing out  new farming methods such as processing  dried fruit  drive this way pineapples and bananas  can not only be conserved and further  processed they also fetch a higher price  solar energy helps farmers deal with  other challenges like irrigation  Cristina Lopez is installing a new  solar-powered water pump up to now she'd  been using a diesel motor to pump water  from the well to the fields that was bad  for the environment and came at a  significant cost to the small farm  botany Qatar Kanpur and Oh Seminole Naga  you have to buy a lot of fuel to get the  pump to work and i